1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,841
Finding a home should be exciting.

2
00:00:03,391 --> 00:00:05,205
But for tenants and landlords,

3
00:00:05,385 --> 00:00:08,137
a rental deposit can create uncertainty,

4
00:00:08,317 --> 00:00:09,277
mistrust,

5
00:00:09,457 --> 00:00:10,609
and disputes.

6
00:00:11,159 --> 00:00:13,356
Fiável starts with a simple question:

7
00:00:13,616 --> 00:00:14,612
what if the rules were clear

8
00:00:14,612 --> 00:00:15,664
from day one?

9
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:18,993
Fiável is building

10
00:00:18,993 --> 00:00:21,104
a more transparent way to rent.

11
00:00:21,654 --> 00:00:23,297
It brings lease conditions,

12
00:00:23,477 --> 00:00:24,373
payments,

13
00:00:24,553 --> 00:00:25,961
deposit protection,

14
00:00:26,141 --> 00:00:29,447
and guided actions into one connected experience.

15
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:34,771
Both sides can follow the rental journey:

16
00:00:35,031 --> 00:00:36,119
what was agreed,

17
00:00:36,299 --> 00:00:37,515
what has been paid,

18
00:00:37,695 --> 00:00:38,676
what is due,

19
00:00:38,856 --> 00:00:41,309
and what happens when a problem arises.

20
00:00:41,859 --> 00:00:43,139
Less ambiguity.

21
00:00:43,689 --> 00:00:45,055
More accountability.

22
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,387
Underneath Fiável is LeaseVault,

23
00:00:54,567 --> 00:00:57,425
a Soroban smart contract on Stellar Testnet.

24
00:00:57,975 --> 00:01:00,955
It is designed to hold the rental guarantee

25
00:01:00,955 --> 00:01:03,458
and enforce defined rules for payments,

26
00:01:03,638 --> 00:01:04,491
claims,

27
00:01:04,671 --> 00:01:05,695
deadlines,

28
00:01:05,875 --> 00:01:07,027
and releases.

29
00:01:07,577 --> 00:01:09,455
When an action happens on-chain,

30
00:01:09,635 --> 00:01:12,579
its transaction can be independently verified.

31
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:19,143
Fiável's agents help tenants

32
00:01:19,143 --> 00:01:21,221
and landlords understand their lease,

33
00:01:21,401 --> 00:01:22,639
review deadlines,

34
00:01:22,819 --> 00:01:24,419
and prepare their next steps.

35
00:01:24,969 --> 00:01:26,931
They explain the available rules;

36
00:01:27,191 --> 00:01:29,260
they do not replace the contract

37
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:31,799
or take control away from the people involved.

38
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:38,469
Where supported,

39
00:01:38,649 --> 00:01:42,024
Fiável explores putting eligible deposit funds

40
00:01:42,024 --> 00:01:43,151
to work through Blend,

41
00:01:43,331 --> 00:01:45,805
with explicit consent and clear limits.

42
00:01:46,355 --> 00:01:48,041
Investment involves risk,

43
00:01:48,221 --> 00:01:50,311
and returns are never guaranteed.

44
00:01:53,860 --> 00:01:56,121
Trust grows through accountable behavior.

45
00:01:56,671 --> 00:01:59,765
Fiável is also exploring rental reputation,

46
00:01:59,945 --> 00:02:01,336
so both sides can make

47
00:02:01,336 --> 00:02:04,318
better-informed decisions using transparent,

48
00:02:04,498 --> 00:02:06,546
appropriately verified history.

49
00:02:08,660 --> 00:02:11,305
By combining rental-focused smart contracts,

50
00:02:11,485 --> 00:02:12,680
Stellar payments,

51
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:14,033
guided agents,

52
00:02:14,213 --> 00:02:16,261
and a transparent user experience,

53
00:02:16,441 --> 00:02:18,957
Fiável brings blockchain technology to

54
00:02:18,957 --> 00:02:21,433
a problem people actually understand.

55
00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:28,135
Fiável.

56
00:02:28,685 --> 00:02:29,837
Fair rentals,

57
00:02:30,017 --> 00:02:31,211
built on trust.

58
00:02:31,761 --> 00:02:32,913
Built on Stellar.
